{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19110","headline":"寄杨虢州与之旧姻 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄杨虢州与之旧姻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避地江湖知几春，今来本郡拥朱轮。\n阮郎无复里中旧，杨仆却爲关外人。\n各系一官难命驾，每怀前好易沾巾。\n玉城山里多灵药，摆落功名且养神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}